  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'jew mad?' and 'get fuhrererious!' which directly address the viewer with a provocative, hateful question and a sarcastic, dehumanizing suggestion. The meme uses these texts to imply the user (or a group the user identifies with) is being mocked or challenged to react in a way that reinforces the antisemitic stereotypes. The projection is onto the textual material, which acts as a direct address to the viewer.",
